<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 10.2 points to 757.6 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 10.2 points to 757.6 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 10.2 points on Tuesday to 757.6 points in thin holiday trading, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>All 10 of the sectoral indices rose with the banking index rising most, 2.71 percent.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
